Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.22,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,And that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:13.84,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,With this, at long last...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:14.82,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,It's finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:17.78,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:25.50,Default,Student1,0,0,0,,One melon and yakisoba bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:25.50,Default-Alt,Student2,0,0,0,,Cream bread please! Cream bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:26.87,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Pshuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.87,0:00:27.96,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Pshuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:30.67,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pshuuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.69,0:00:32.63,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pshuuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:35.86,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,One egg salad sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:37.60,Default,Obaasan,0,0,0,,Here, one egg salad sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.21,0:00:41.31,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:43.39,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I finally bought it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:46.06,Default,Obaasan,0,0,0,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.06,0:00:50.53,Default,Obaasan,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure if you'd be able to buy one\N on your own before you graduated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:53.55,Default,Obaasan,0,0,0,,This is on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.38,0:00:55.99,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:01:01.01,Default,Fanclub1,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy bought herself bread without our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:02.95,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.57,0:02:36.93,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,The Man From Brazil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:40.93,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,This monja riceball is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:43.08,Default,Leona,0,0,0,[term fix],If you say so, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:45.11,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.11,0:02:50.27,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I got this plum rice ball from the lady running the lunch stand, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.27,0:02:51.69,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[term fix],Would you like it, Laala?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.69,0:02:52.46,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.46,0:02:54.36,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah! Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.36,0:02:55.51,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.51,0:02:59.32,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I only have Red Flash before concerts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:01.48,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Then I'll help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:04.20,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.63,0:03:06.79,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sour!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:11.31,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That reminds me, Head Disciplinarian Minami \Nalready had herself a solo concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.31,0:03:12.56,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,How unfair!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.56,0:03:16.71,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,That's 'cause our spineless manager \Nhas holed himself up in a beauty parlor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:20.43,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,[term fix],If Dressing Pafé reforms,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.43,0:03:24.45,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,that curse will take away my handsomeness-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:27.60,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,There's no way I'll let that happen-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:29.89,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Anti-aging-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.32,0:03:32.76,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Kuma and Usagi both believe in this curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.76,0:03:33.86,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.86,0:03:36.76,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That stupid Usagi has gone weak in the knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:38.10,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:40.20,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Once convinced, there's no changing his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:42.32,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,At this point, anything we say\Ngoes in one ear and out the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:45.53,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of curse it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:48.36,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,So you're afraid of curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.36,0:03:50.33,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],What a chicken, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.25,0:03:55.31,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I made fun of curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.31,0:03:57.60,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.51,0:03:57.60,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:03:59.96,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Even a moment of weakness can prove fatal in the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.10,0:04:05.80,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,It silently circles around behind its prey,\N ready to strike at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:11.95,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.95,0:04:13.35,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,A gold medal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.35,0:04:14.86,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What's with you, old man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:16.57,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Don't sneak up on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:18.40,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,These are school grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:20.57,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Outsiders are prohibited from entering here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.57,0:04:22.81,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,My my my.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.81,0:04:24.01,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Calm yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.01,0:04:26.18,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I am no stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:30.29,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],I'm only here to hug my truly beloved Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.85,0:04:32.75,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Forcing a hug on a young lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.75,0:04:34.96,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Is inexcusable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:37.17,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,How repulsive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.50,0:04:41.71,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Regardless of how passionate a fan you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.71,0:04:43.67,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,This is absurd, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:46.82,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,It's a principal's duty to protect their students!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.82,0:04:48.56,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,This shall not go unpunished!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.56,0:04:49.59,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.59,0:04:51.10,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:51.93,Default,3,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.93,0:04:52.85,Default,2,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:53.81,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.37,0:04:56.59,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.59,0:04:58.52,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:04:59.59,Default,3,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:03.22,Default,3,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:10.56,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Please excuse us.\NWe had no idea you were her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.56,0:05:12.16,Default,Others,0,0,0,,We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:14.92,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],Well, I had to find Sophy as soon as I could,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.92,0:05:17.88,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,and rushed straight here from the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:21.69,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Of course my actions made it look strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.55,0:05:26.09,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],He's completely different from you, Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.74,0:05:29.14,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I take after my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.14,0:05:32.93,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Unlike myself, my father's full of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:35.06,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,After all, he's an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:35.91,Default,All,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.91,0:05:37.02,Default,All,0,0,0,,Adventurer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.15,0:05:40.48,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Here's my card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.18,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Ah, let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.18,0:05:46.20,Default,Title,0,0,0,,King of Adventure, Location: Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:49.66,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,When you're an adventurer, every day is full of excitement!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.21,0:05:52.62,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Taking killer pictures on the back of a killer whale,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:55.33,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,owling in a giant owl sleeping bag,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.33,0:05:57.29,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,tagging a tiger,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:05:59.69,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,being pigged up on by a bunch of pigs...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:01.63,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Your gags are beyond the max!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.99,0:06:05.30,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Principal, I've brought you a souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:07.20,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,A-A snake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:09.84,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,It's fake made out of rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:13.60,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Since it has a zipper along the side of it, it's great for storing bamboo poles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:15.56,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.92,0:06:19.96,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],To be honest, we've been separated for quite some time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.96,0:06:22.70,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,but now we'll be able to live together once agian.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:24.53,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,That's what I came to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.93,0:06:26.53,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:27.99,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Isn't that great, Sophy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.99,0:06:31.72,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Since I lack the physical strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:37.96,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,my father has been flying around the world in search of the legendary powerful plum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.35,0:06:40.57,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Powerful plum?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.57,0:06:42.24,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:43.89,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,When it comes to its power,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.89,0:06:46.76,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,it's said that one can run 30,000 meters with just one,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:48.47,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,making it the ultimate plum!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:49.93,Default,All,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:55.53,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,However, even after ten long years,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.53,0:06:59.38,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I still haven't found that legendary powerful plum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.38,0:07:02.42,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,But I'll never give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.42,0:07:04.65,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,If I can't find it, I'll just make it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.31,0:07:11.36,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,That's when I purchased a stockpile of legendary-grade\N plum seeds from a Brazilian merchant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.01,0:07:14.12,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Her dad sure is decisive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.12,0:07:17.20,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I require precise calculations,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.20,0:07:18.83,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,so we're complete opposites in that regard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:20.68,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Do not fear failure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.68,0:07:22.33,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Challenge yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:24.75,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Those are my mottos.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:28.80,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[honorific],That is why I give you this, madam...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.80,0:07:30.48,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,Yes yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:32.01,Default,Principal,0,0,0,,A tr-transfer notification?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:33.72,Default,5,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.34,0:07:36.09,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],Hold on, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.09,0:07:39.18,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't remember anything about transfer---
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.19,0:07:41.76,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],Are you surprised, Sophy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.76,0:07:46.15,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Your father has created Prifornia,\Na 10,000 hectare plum plantation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.15,0:07:48.62,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Prifornia?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.62,0:07:49.89,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What prefecture is that in?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.89,0:07:50.86,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,It's another country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.86,0:07:52.26,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.26,0:07:55.07,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],That means Sophy's going to another country?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:58.54,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy and I will be leaving Japan next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:04.80,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],And we'll arrive just in time to have the plum flowers greet you in full bloom, Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.80,0:08:06.07,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.25,0:08:13.66,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:16.37,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Are you really going to Prifornia?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:18.39,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.18,0:09:01.72,Default,Alokan,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:13.48,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Wondrous Angel à la mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.35,0:09:17.00,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'll help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:19.07,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:20.99,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:20.99,Default-Alt,Mikan,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.95,0:09:25.13,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.85,0:09:49.84,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,You're full-blown celebrities-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.84,0:09:50.82,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,I'm thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:52.14,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Of course we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.14,0:09:56.08,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,After all, our destiny is to become Divine Idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:10:01.37,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Next up is SoLaMi SMILE's hit concert \Nfrom before they broke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:06.29,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,The three of them get along perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:08.00,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Exactly what I'd expect of SoLaMi Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.00,0:10:10.73,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,However, according to my research,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:15.97,Default,Neko,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy's dad has returned home and\N asked her to live with him in Prifornia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.41,0:10:19.18,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,There's plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.18,0:10:23.32,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[term fix],Aroma Prophecy Grimoire, chapter 8, section 184:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:26.68,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,"Recall the lightening which tears the sky."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.25,0:10:38.88,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Derodero derosaimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:41.00,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,While it seems to trouble thee,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.00,0:10:45.67,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'll say that SoLaMi Smile is not a proper fit for thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.67,0:10:49.94,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I hath seen what thine future has in store.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.94,0:10:51.48,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I won't go into the unfortunate details,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.48,0:10:55.12,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,but it would be to thy advantage to break away from SoLaMi Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.12,0:10:57.92,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Break away from SoLaMi Smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.37,0:11:03.33,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[term fix],If ye continue to team up with the overly powerful Laala and Mirei,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.33,0:11:07.14,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,thine presence shall continue to dwindle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.84,0:11:11.77,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,That is, so to say, a step toward becoming an invisible idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.77,0:11:12.98,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.98,0:11:15.11,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,I'm Mikan the angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.11,0:11:18.79,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Spending time abroad with your father sounds wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.79,0:11:24.83,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,If you go abroad, things like pizza and \Nhamburgers will be bigger and more fun to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:26.62,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,I'd be totally jelly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.79,0:11:31.30,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Pitiful lamb, worry about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.30,0:11:32.58,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Yes, be troubled!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.58,0:11:35.47,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,When people are struggling and\Nsuffering with their problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.47,0:11:39.59,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,that is the greatest feast for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.11,0:11:43.38,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.38,0:11:45.80,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Jello-jello Angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:52.02,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],So this is where you've been, Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:56.98,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:06.88,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,My father's been searching for a\Npowerful plum for me for ten years,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.88,0:12:08.58,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,and he's finally found some.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:09.51,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.51,0:12:12.91,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I love my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.07,0:12:21.38,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Hey, Sophy, you know how we're doing our best to reform SoLaMi Smile, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.08,0:12:22.90,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.90,0:12:28.60,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Well, if living together with your father\Nthat you love so much will make you happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:30.64,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I won't stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.64,0:12:32.47,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'll support you all the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.47,0:12:33.56,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[term fix],Laala...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:36.12,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I feel the same way-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.12,0:12:38.49,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Don't worry about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.49,0:12:41.61,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You should choose the path that you want-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.94,0:12:44.20,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,That I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:46.57,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,That I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.73,0:12:54.97,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't want to go to Prifornia!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.97,0:12:58.97,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[term fix],I want to continue doing PriPara with you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.97,0:13:00.30,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:01.51,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:03.47,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,That makes me really happy-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.84,0:13:12.72,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,[term fix],Now you just need to tell\Nyour father how you truly feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.72,0:13:19.40,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I don't want to see\Nmy beloved father saddened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.93,0:13:20.97,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.97,0:13:23.32,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You shouldn't keep anything from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.32,0:13:25.36,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You have to properly tell him your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:29.68,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Your father did it because he wanted to-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.68,0:13:31.33,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll understand-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:36.85,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[term fix],Laala, Mirei, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.85,0:13:37.54,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.18,0:13:42.00,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,...go tell my father my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.43,0:13:47.74,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You here, Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:50.45,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Ah, welcome back-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:52.32,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,The usual-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.45,0:13:55.06,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.25,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Why are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.25,0:13:58.16,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I should be saying the same thing-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.16,0:13:59.19,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Wha'd you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.19,0:14:03.15,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Would the two of you care for bratcurse?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.15,0:14:04.99,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Bratcurse?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.99,0:14:07.29,Default,Nako,0,0,0,,Bratwurst.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.29,0:14:08.49,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You scared us-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.49,0:14:11.49,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,We're quite sensitive to the word "curse" as of late-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.49,0:14:13.37,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Though, I'll take one-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.70,0:14:14.78,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.78,0:14:17.43,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Just give me a moment-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.43,0:14:20.08,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Because my accursed movements are a little slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.08,0:14:22.56,Default,2,0,0,0,,A curse?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.05,0:14:28.12,Default,2,0,0,0,,It's cute how scared you get-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.82,0:14:35.98,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,This is the Prifornia plum plantation that we'll be living at.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:38.61,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,What do you think? It's huge, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.61,0:14:39.70,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.70,0:14:41.50,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:44.09,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.09,0:14:48.54,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Your father will handle all of\Nthe heavy lifting at the plantation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:49.42,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.42,0:14:49.91,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.91,0:14:56.55,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't want to go to Prifornia!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.55,0:14:59.65,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,There are still things I want to do here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:04.05,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy, explain it to me slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.85,0:15:05.53,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.53,0:15:06.59,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.59,0:15:09.80,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of a complicated discussion...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.97,0:15:11.03,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.03,0:15:12.85,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,You're kidding?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.90,0:15:18.19,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Now then, I'll go comfort myself\Nat Neko Cafe again today-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:18.97,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.97,0:15:19.56,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.41,0:15:23.23,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Enter me into a concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:24.61,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.10,0:15:28.40,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy's doing a solo concert?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:31.99,Default,Fanclub1,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],You said Lady Sophy's having a solo concert?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:33.37,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.37,0:15:36.16,Default,Fanclub1,0,0,0,,It appears buying bread at the school cafe wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:39.37,Default,Fanclub1,0,0,0,,Now she's trying to do a solo concert on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.37,0:15:43.16,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],We, her Royal Guard, will cheer Sophy on...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.16,0:15:45.50,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,[honorific],with the ultimate cheer we've been working on chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:51.07,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.07,0:15:52.39,Default,Fanclub1,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Lady Sophy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.39,0:15:53.43,Default,All,0,0,0,,is life!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.39,0:15:56.31,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.31,0:15:57.51,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,You're kidding?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:16:00.68,Default,Sister,0,0,0,[honorific],What happened, Father?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.68,0:16:03.28,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,It's already done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.28,0:16:08.63,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Although the several hundred seeds I planted have bloomed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:11.20,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,there wasn't a single plum to be found;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:13.20,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,they were all cherries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.17,0:16:15.37,Default,Both,0,0,0,[honorific],Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:17.83,Default-Alt,Sister,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:17.83,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],Pull yourself together, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.84,0:16:22.37,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,He just naturally goes at cosmic speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.37,0:16:24.76,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,and never stops to think things through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.76,0:16:26.54,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],How unfortunate, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.54,0:16:29.80,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,He might not be able to get back on his feet quickly like he normally does.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.80,0:16:31.32,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.21,0:16:41.02,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number\Nof My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.73,0:16:43.53,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.69,0:16:48.86,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,A late blooming sakura coord decorated with cherry blossoms in full bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.86,0:16:53.28,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,[term fix],The dyed purple sakura leaves add to the cool taste that fits your image.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:55.84,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Flower Blossom Floral Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.14,0:17:06.09,Default-Alt,Fan,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],I love you, Lady Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.09,0:17:07.29,Default-Alt,Fan2,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.29,0:17:09.50,Default-Alt,Fan2,0,0,0,,So beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:13.55,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Have you been good, my little cagebirds?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.55,0:17:15.26,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:17.97,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.90,0:17:25.39,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I have prepared the perfect song for you bad little girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.89,0:17:30.36,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,"Solar Flare Sherbet Sakura Shower Version".
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:15.11,Default,All,0,0,0,[term fix],{\pos(960,990)}Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.46,0:18:18.07,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],{\pos(960,990)}S-Sophy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.51,0:18:21.60,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've got this much energy now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.60,0:18:25.04,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doing concerts with PriPara is her energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:37.17,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.17,0:18:39.30,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Plums, peaches...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:40.93,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Cherry blossoms in full bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.35,0:18:50.12,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Liberation Maiden Primavera!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.27,0:18:55.27,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:21.26,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],{\move(960,990,960,1030.5,500,800)}Cheer up, Father. Sakura and plums are both plums.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.69,0:19:24.01,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],S-Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.29,0:19:41.64,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Purple, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.64,0:19:44.24,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Miss Sophy is a Cool-type idol, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.99,0:19:50.43,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,You're really heading back already?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.43,0:19:52.12,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Even though I wasn't able to get dried plums,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.12,0:19:54.29,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,the cherry trees will grow cherries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.29,0:19:56.29,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I need to rush back and harvest them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:19:59.26,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],That's what your concert taught me, Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.26,0:20:00.72,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.56,0:20:05.38,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Thank you for that splendid concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.38,0:20:08.78,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],You've always lacked physical strength, Sophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:12.29,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,But with the energetic concert you put on with everyone's support,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.29,0:20:15.31,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,you've made your old man proud enough he could ascend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.34,0:20:18.96,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy, do your best at PriPara,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:20.28,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,and become a divine idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.85,0:20:23.24,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],Thank you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.77,0:20:25.89,Default,Dad,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Laala, Mirei,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.89,0:20:28.24,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,please continue to look after my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:29.08,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,Will do!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.16,0:20:36.04,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:39.54,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.54,0:20:40.71,Default,Others,0,0,0,[term fix],Sophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.71,0:20:41.56,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:42.79,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,My oh my,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.79,0:20:45.80,Default,Sis,0,0,0,,you really did a cosmic job this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.51,0:20:48.80,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sohpie, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.85,0:20:54.44,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,The SoLaMi Smile break-up strategy was a complete failure-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:57.83,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Her flower filled concert was spectacular!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.83,0:21:01.40,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,But Mikan likes meat buns more than flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:03.53,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The prophecy was a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:07.62,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Now that it's come to this, I shall consult the forbidden and most horrific prophecy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.66,0:21:15.48,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The next prophecy; chapter 7, section 666:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.48,0:21:18.00,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,"The one with crimson eyes strikes back."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:20.53,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[honorific],If I turn the large number of mega-nees into zombies,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.53,0:21:22.26,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,SoLaMi Smile will...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:25.30,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,No, I'll be able to take down {\i1}everyone{\i0} in PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.10,0:21:30.77,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.77,0:21:34.35,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,182)}Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.69,0:23:07.78,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,There's a problem-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.78,0:23:10.72,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Do you think you can do a concert\Nat the Dream Theatre-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.07,0:23:13.20,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We don't even have a five person team yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.20,0:23:16.76,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It has been decided you will have your debut live at the theater's completion ceremony-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.76,0:23:20.25,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,However, the catch is,\Nyou have to win the sports festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.25,0:23:21.02,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.02,0:23:24.37,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We'll win and reform!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.37,0:23:26.42,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Wait, if you do that, the curse...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.42,0:23:28.33,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'm in trouble-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.33,0:23:29.16,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.16,0:23:31.77,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,First to the Dream Theatre-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.77,0:23:33.10,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.10,0:23:34.55,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
